tasks.spec:
Implement the AutoSprink 'Hydrant Flow Calculator': smoothbore nozzle discharge from outlet coefficient, diameter, and pitot pressure, using the cited standard smoothbore discharge formula (NFPA 291 style — verify adopted edition): Q = 29.83 * c * d^2 * sqrt(P), Q in gpm, d = orifice diameter in INCHES, P = pitot pressure in psi, c = discharge coefficient (0 < c <= 1).

Exports (exact):
- export const SMOOTHBORE_CONSTANT = 29.83;
- export interface HydrantFlowInput { coefficient: number; diameterIn: number; pitotPsi: number; }
- export interface HydrantFlowResult { flowGpm: number; formula: 'Q = 29.83 * c * d^2 * sqrt(P)'; input: HydrantFlowInput; }
- export function hydrantFlow(input: HydrantFlowInput): HydrantFlowResult — throws on non-finite/non-positive diameter or pitot, or coefficient outside (0, 1].

Tests: c=0.9, d=2.5, P=36 -> Q = 29.83*0.9*6.25*6 = 1006.7625 (toBeCloseTo 4 digits); coefficient 1 upper bound accepted; each throw case (c=0, c>1, d<=0, P<0, NaN).

